#: includes/admin-pages.php:638
msgid "Which address a filter button links to. Visitors with JavaScript are not affected: the script handles every click itself and can always combine terms. The links only matter for crawlers and for browsers without JavaScript. \"Single terms only\" links each term to its own page, so crawlers find one page per term instead of every combination."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-pages.php:661
msgid "Filter pages with up to this many selected terms may be indexed (index, follow). Pages with more terms are sent as noindex, nofollow - unless their canonical points to another page (see the canonical settings below), which replaces the noindex. Pages with unknown terms or no results are always noindex, nofollow without a canonical. 0 = no filter page is indexed. Default: 1."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-pages.php:673
